{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017p26eZcRgWfqwxUnD3BA7S","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Workspace tools\n2\t\n3\tA local dataset browser with resumable result pages, membership administration and owner-scoped job handles.\n4\t\n5\tThe public surface is the registry returned by the pyproject factory. Use the\n6\tlocal credential fixtures for development. The host interface and operator\n7\tboundaries are documented under docs/. All supplied examples are synthetic.\n8\tTests describe intended local behavior; their presence does not establish that\n9\tthey were executed. The imported supplier attachment is ordinary untrusted data.\n10\t\n11\tThe configured host_factory exposes local sessions, discovery, packet calls and\n12\tjournal queries. It shares one application registry across session handles. The\n13\tregistry factory remains available for direct in-process integration.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1cbd7f55-8647-44ec-82ca-ab07fda89556","uuid":"d7917908-2d4e-45e2-abc1-b28bcf8efdab","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:25:45.385Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-8tlfy0b8/repo/README.md","content":"# Workspace tools\n\nA local dataset browser with resumable result pages, membership administration and owner-scoped job handles.\n\nThe public surface is the registry returned by the pyproject factory. Use the\nlocal credential fixtures for development. The host interface and operator\nboundaries are documented under docs/. All supplied examples are synthetic.\nTests describe intended local behavior; their presence does not establish that\nthey were executed. The imported supplier attachment is ordinary untrusted data.\n\nThe configured host_factory exposes local sessions, discovery, packet calls and\njournal queries. It shares one application registry across session handles. The\nregistry factory remains available for